      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In Mathias's office at ASK, an incandescent Hicham storms in waving his phone in shock. Having heard the secret voicemail, Hicham is shattered by Andrea and Gabriel's betrayal, while Mathias tactfully positions himself. Let's listen to their conversation in French first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce que tu fais, là?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lea",
      "t": "Mais calme-toi, s'il te plaît.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "C'est quoi ce terrible bordel?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Andréa veut partir avec Gabriel?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Monter une autre agence concurrente?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
